    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPALG is a runner in 3-dimensional space, where you jump and turn around the tube, and your goal is to reach the finish without touching any spikes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/b7f5fbbc84bc31736c3e5439d61cc64e.poster.avif?t=1743688188\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/b7f5fbbc84bc31736c3e5439d61cc64e.webm?t=1743688188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/b7f5fbbc84bc31736c3e5439d61cc64e.mp4?t=1743688188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge a variety of obstacles including: spikes, chasms, gravity portals, etc.<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/d7ce6e4ead3428817db588c4626d552c.poster.avif?t=1743688188\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/d7ce6e4ead3428817db588c4626d552c.webm?t=1743688188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/d7ce6e4ead3428817db588c4626d552c.mp4?t=1743688188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jumps on platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on the platforms. and fall back on surface<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501010/extras/f52f54c405074439ce250c82c975fd26.poster.avif?t=1743688188\" width=450 height=15